Server init.

>> x := Blob berria: 65 mota: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programa ezarpena: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server lotu: (
 Zerrenda berria ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Zerrenda berria ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x nondik: 0 luzera: 1), lerro-jauzia.
x askatu.

